WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.400
Seven principles for anyone in

2
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.660
public office, counted down in

3
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.160
Lord Nolan's order.

4
00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:08.910
A countdown, not a ranking.

5
00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:11.900
Number seven.

6
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:14.880
Selflessness. Act solely in the

7
00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.010
public interest.

8
00:00:16.485 --> 00:00:19.425
Number six.

9
00:00:19.425 --> 00:00:22.305
Integrity. Owe nothing to anyone

10
00:00:22.305 --> 00:00:24.505
who might sway you, and declare

11
00:00:24.505 --> 00:00:25.655
your interests.

12
00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:28.050
Number five.

13
00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:31.350
Objectivity. Decide fairly,

14
00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:34.060
impartially, and on merit.

15
00:00:34.526 --> 00:00:36.946
Number four.

16
00:00:36.946 --> 00:00:39.506
Accountability. Answer to the

17
00:00:39.506 --> 00:00:41.976
public, and welcome scrutiny.

18
00:00:42.569 --> 00:00:44.949
Number three.

19
00:00:44.949 --> 00:00:48.149
Openness. Be transparent.

20
00:00:48.149 --> 00:00:50.509
Withhold information only for

21
00:00:50.509 --> 00:00:52.279
clear, lawful reasons.

22
00:00:52.762 --> 00:00:54.782
Number two.

23
00:00:54.782 --> 00:00:57.922
Honesty. Be truthful.

24
00:00:57.922 --> 00:01:00.242
Short to say, and not always

25
00:01:00.242 --> 00:01:01.052
easy.

26
00:01:01.489 --> 00:01:02.909
Number one.

27
00:01:02.909 --> 00:01:05.729
Leadership. Show these

28
00:01:05.729 --> 00:01:07.589
principles yourself, and

29
00:01:07.589 --> 00:01:08.949
challenge poor behaviour

30
00:01:08.949 --> 00:01:10.659
wherever it occurs.

31
00:01:11.243 --> 00:01:12.243
A memory trick:

32
00:01:12.243 --> 00:01:17.063
S, I, O, A, O, H, L.

33
00:01:17.063 --> 00:01:20.923
Seven Itchy Owls Always Order

34
00:01:20.923 --> 00:01:21.823
Hot Lassi.

35
00:01:21.823 --> 00:01:24.653
Silly, so it sticks.

36
00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:26.453
For GS4:

37
00:01:26.453 --> 00:01:28.800
these came from Britain's Nolan

38
00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:30.420
Committee in nineteen ninety

39
00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:33.320
five. India's 2nd ARC Ethics

40
00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:35.590
report speaks in similar terms.
